Closure `let`s in 709-1700: 28 (785 .. 1692). Share verdict reads about 15: wsSocket (network.sockets), peerIdentifierMap, houseIslands, siblings, siblingGate, peerClassMap, selfSlotFedGate, antigenRing, nexusMembership, sealRegistry, faceViews, ownCarriageBoard, ownHostingDocs, edgeShadows, protectedDocs (plus kahuProtected, kahuCanon, wornFaceProven, kahuStandings, peerSessions, custodyGroup inside the guard decider).

